WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.909
Circle, square, circle, square. What comes next?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.059
The next shape is a circle because the unit repeats.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.952
One, two, three, one, two, three. What comes next?

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.165
The next number is one. The unit has three numbers.
